00:33:25.280 --> 00:33:29.320
What is the matter with the Edgemoor Company this time?

00:33:30.350 --> 00:33:35.020
One end of the Brooklyn Bridge is falling down of old age, but they hope to have the

00:33:35.020 --> 00:33:39.660
